{
  "//": "Where a 4.7 installation keeps what migration reads. Learned from the 4.7.28 code (bin/install.mjs, plugin/scripts/session-start-core.mjs, plugin/scripts/nightly-scheduler.mjs, kb/brain-profile.mjs) and from the names of the files in a real 4.7 home. Migration only reads these; it never writes, moves or deletes any of them.",
